! IEEE 13-Bus Modular Distribution Feeder (Multi-File)
Clear

New Circuit.IEEE13Mod basekv=115.0 pu=1.03 phases=3 bus1=SourceBus

New Transformer.SubXfmr phases=3 windings=2 buses=[SourceBus, Bus650] kvs=[115, 4.16] kvas=[5000, 5000] %loadloss=1.0 xhl=8.0

Redirect sub/LineCodes.dss
Redirect sub/Lines.dss
Redirect sub/Loads.dss

Set VoltageBases = [115, 4.16]
CalcVoltageBases
Solve
